## THE APP

BOARDPASS is the daily app for every Kenyan nurse, employed or unemployed. Interview preparation plus ward readiness plus community, in one mobile-first PWA.

Tagline: *Every Kenyan nurse. Every shift. Every interview. Ready.*

Founder story: The founder is an unemployed Kenyan male nurse. He went to what he thought was a casual meeting with a hospital boss that turned into a surprise interview. He was asked Kenyan-specific questions no YouTube video prepares you for. He froze. This app exists so no Kenyan nurse freezes again.

North star for every screen: *"Finally — someone who actually understands what we go through."*

