## ABSOLUTE DESIGN LAW — READ THIS FIRST

**ZERO BORDERS ANYWHERE IN THE APP.**

Not on cards. Not on buttons. Not on inputs. Not on modals. Not on wrong answer blocks. Not on right answer blocks. Not on list items. Not on tabs. Not on bottom nav. Not anywhere. Zero borders.

If you are about to add a border, stop and use a background color difference instead. This rule overrides everything else.

**The look:** Solid, clean, calm, like GitHub on mobile. Not glassy. Not transparent. Not floating. Every text block sits inside a card with solid background. Nothing floats naked on the background.

**Colors — dark mode:**
- Background: `#0d1117`
- Card: `#161b22`
- Text: `#e6edf3`
- Muted text: `#8b949e`
- Accent: `#58a6ff`
- Danger: `#f85149`
- Success: `#3fb950`
- Warning: `#d29922`

**Colors — light mode:**
- Background: `#ffffff`
- Card: `#f0f3f6`
- Text: `#1f2328`
- Muted text: `#656d76`
- Accent: `#0969da`
- Danger: `#cf222e`
- Success: `#1a7f37`
- Warning: `#9a6700`

**Other design rules:**
- Card radius: 8px. Card padding: 16px. Gap between cards: 16px. Gap inside card: 12px. Screen edge padding: 24px.
- No shadows. No gradients. No glass. No backdrop blur except on modal backdrops.
- Edge-to-edge mobile. Respect `env(safe-area-inset-top)` and `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)`.
- Bottom nav has `bg-card` background. Main content has `bg-background`. Color difference is the separator.
- No emojis in UI (only in user-generated content).
- Typography: system font or Inter. Body 16px, line height 1.6.
- Theme: dark, light, or system. Respects user setting, no flash on load.
- Language: English and Swahili toggle.
- Every toggle button (bookmark, like, mastered) fills and unfills instantly on tap with no loading spinner. Optimistic update, then silent Supabase write. If write fails, revert and show toast.
- All dropdowns are custom (never native `<select>`). Bottom sheet on mobile.
- All modals are bottom sheets on mobile, centered dialogs on desktop.
- Toasts at top, 3 seconds auto-dismiss, one at a time.
- Skeleton loaders, not spinners.
- Every list has an empty state with icon, headline, body, and action button.
- Every destructive action has a confirmation modal.
- Wrong answer block: background `rgba(248,81,73,0.12)` dark / `rgba(248,81,73,0.08)` light, radius 8px, padding 16px. **NO border, NO left stripe, NO outline.** The tint itself is the signal.
- Right answer block: background `rgba(63,185,80,0.12)` dark / `rgba(63,185,80,0.08)` light, radius 8px, padding 16px. **NO border, NO left stripe, NO outline.** The tint itself is the signal.

