## USER FLOW

**Sign up:** Email + password. Required checkbox "I am 18+ and agree to Terms, Privacy, Guidelines." Auto sign in after signup. Land on Home.

**Sign in:** Email + password. "Forgot password?" link below password opens reset modal. Handle all errors gracefully:
- "Email not confirmed" → show confirmation screen with resend button
- "Invalid login credentials" → inline "Wrong email or password."
- "User not found" → inline "No account with this email. Sign up first."
- "Rate limit" → inline "Too many attempts. Wait a minute."

**No onboarding.** Straight to Home after auth.

**Home / Today tab:** streak counter top right, Resume card (if applicable), Today's scenario card, Drug calc drill, Ward tip, Community preview (3 posts).

**Interview tab:** search bar, filter chips (facility level, department, trap type), "Add facility you're interviewing at" optional prompt, scenario list.

**Scenario detail:** title + badges, image, scenario text (EN/SW toggle), expandable "What they're testing," wrong answer card (tinted red, no border), right answer card (tinted green, no border), audio player (premium, EN/SW), external resources, comments, action row (Mark Read/Revised/Mastered, Save, Share, Download offline).

**Paywall:** after 5 free scenarios. Plans: Monthly KES 299, Season KES 699 (3mo), Half-year KES 1,199 (6mo), One-time KES 2,499 (first 100 only). M-Pesa via IntaSend Edge Function only.

**Community tab:** pinned guidelines banner, 4 filter chips (Interview Experiences, Ward Tips, General, Job Alerts), feed of posts, floating [+ Post] button (premium only), report button on every post.

**Profile tab:** avatar, email, subscription card, stats (streak, read, mastered, saved, coins), streak calendar, saved scenarios, settings (language EN/SW, theme light/dark/system, notification toggle, analytics toggle, facility), Legal section (Privacy, Terms, Guidelines, Cookies, Data Deletion, app version), Delete account button, Logout.

**Admin panel** (`/admin`, password-gated, only users with `metadata.is_admin = true`): scenarios CRUD, reported posts moderation, facilities verify, legal pages editor with version history, analytics summary, user list. All destructive actions require typing "DELETE" to confirm. All actions logged to `admin_logs`.

