Service worker caches: home shell, last 50 scenarios viewed, downloaded scenarios (free and premium both), audio files user tapped, legal pages.

"Download for offline" button on every scenario. Progress writes queue in IndexedDB, sync to Supabase when online.

Offline banner at top when `navigator.onLine === false`: "Offline — showing saved content."

Sync indicator when queued writes flush.

