## COMMUNITY SAFETY

- Report button on every post, comment, and reply (visible always, not hidden)
- Report modal: reason radio (Spam, Harassment, Wrong info, Other) + optional comment
- 3+ reports → status 'flagged' → hidden from feed → admin review
- Block user button on every profile
- Blocked users' content hidden from blocker
- Profanity filter on post/reply/comment bodies (English + Swahili list)
- External links shown as plain text until admin verifies
- Image upload: JPG/PNG/WebP only, max 5MB, compress client-side to 1MB, strip EXIF
- Never show user email publicly
- Anonymous posts never reveal name or email
- Rate limits: 5 posts/day, 20 comments/day, 3 reports/day per user

