## INTERACTION RULES

- Every toggle button (bookmark, like, mastered) fills and unfills instantly, no spinner, optimistic update, silent Supabase write, revert on failure with toast.
- Double-tap prevention: debounce 300ms.
- Counter updates use RPC functions, never direct UPDATE (RLS blocks counters).
- All modals are bottom sheets on mobile. Escape closes. Backdrop tap closes. Focus trap. Body scroll locked.
- Destructive actions (delete, report, remove) require confirm modal.
- Toasts: top of screen, 3s auto-dismiss, one at a time. Types: success/error/info/warning.
- Skeleton loaders, not spinners. Max 300ms before content or error.
- Empty states with icon, headline, body, action button. Never blank screen.
- Pull-to-refresh on community and interview list (custom, no browser default).
- Every button wired to Supabase. No UI-only buttons except share and download.
- Offline writes queue in IndexedDB, sync in background, revert on failure.

