## ACCESSIBILITY

- All images have alt text
- All icon-only buttons have aria-label
- Focus rings visible: 2px outline `#58a6ff`, offset 2px (this is the ONE exception to the no-border rule — accessibility focus is allowed)
- Color contrast meets WCAG AA
- Forms have `<label for>` linked to inputs
- Error messages have `aria-describedby`
- Modals have `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal`, `aria-labelledby`
- Toasts use `role="status"` `aria-live="polite"`, errors `role="alert"` `aria-live="assertive"`
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (disable animations)
- Respect `prefers-color-scheme` (default to system theme)
- Skip-to-content link on every page

